{
 "brief": "Hezbollah accused Israel's foreign ministry of publishing a map today that incorporates southern Lebanon into Israeli territory, the Shehab wire reported. The party characterized the map as undeniable proof of Israeli territorial ambitions in Lebanon and said Israel would never abandon those claims to Lebanese land and resources.\n\nThe accusation escalates rhetoric around the disputed border region at a moment of heightened tensions between the two sides. Hezbollah called on Lebanese authorities to halt direct negotiations with Israel, citing the map as evidence that Israeli negotiating positions mask broader territorial designs on Lebanese territory.",
